    "paypalGuideAccountP1": "For live donations through the PayPal REST API (as Titanium Kitten uses), you almost always need a business-facing PayPal account – typically a Business account or whatever seller/business type PayPal requires in your country. A plain personal consumer account is usually not sufficient to accept payments on your own website through the REST API.",
